 an arena lined with the undead warriors of the Ash Legion, who block enemy attacks and movement. Enemy heroes near the inside edge of the arena will be attacked by spears, dealing damage and knocking them back.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "冷却时间降低%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒，持续时间提升。如果敌人在竞技场内阵亡，玛尔斯和竞技场内所有友军都会回复%arena_kill_buff_heal_pct%%%最大生命和魔法，并且获得%arena_kill_buff_damage_pct%%%攻击力加成，持续%arena_kill_buff_duration%秒。这个效果可以叠加。", "en": "Lowers cooldown by %bonus_AbilityCooldown%s and increases duration. If an enemy is killed in the Arena, Mars and all of his allies inside the Arena restore %arena_kill_buff_heal_pct%%  of their max health and mana and get a %arena_kill_buff_damage_pct%%  attack damage buff for %arena_kill_buff_duration%s. This effect stacks."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "radius", "width", "spear_damage", "formation_time", "spear_distance_from_wall", "spear_attack_interval", "warrior_count", "warrior_fade_min_dist", "warrior_fade_max_dist", "arena_kill_buff_duration", "arena_kill_buff_damage_pct", "arena_kill_buff_heal_pct", "allied_reduction_pct", "health_regen"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "summons", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_aether_remnant", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·残阴", "name_en": "Aether Remnant", "description_zh": "虚无之灵向目标地点派出一个残像。残像观察着一片区域，面朝矢量的方向。当有目标进入其视线，残像会拉扯，并造成伤害。", "description_en": "Void Spirit dispatches a remnant to the target location. The remnant stands watch over the region, facing the direction of his vector. When a unit crosses its gaze, the remnant pulls it in and damages it.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "额外产生一道观察路径，会围绕残阴旋转。残阴现在会提供真实视域，不再对非英雄单位触发，而是每秒在两道路径上造成%creep_damage_pct%%%伤害。不会使守卫显形。", "en": "Creates an additional watcher path that rotates around the remnant.  The remnant now provides True Sight, and no longer triggers on creeps, instead dealing %creep_damage_pct%%% damage to them every second in both paths. Does not reveal wards."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["start_radius", "end_radius", "radius", "projectile_speed", "remnant_watch_distance", "remnant_watch_radius", "watch_path_vision_radius", "activation_delay", "impact_damage", "pull_duration", "pull_destination", "duration", "think_interval", "pierces_creeps", "damage_tick_rate"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "true_sight", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_dissimilate", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·异化", "name_en": "Dissimilate", "description_zh": "虚无之灵暂时遁入太虚，创造数个灵扉。穿过灵扉他能重组自身。穿出灵扉后，他对区域内所有敌人造成伤害。", "description_en": "Void Spirit temporarily fades into the aether, creating a number of portals through which he can reassemble himself. Upon exiting a portal, he damages all enemies in the area.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["phase_duration", "destination_fx_radius", "portals_per_ring", "angle_per_ring_portal", "first_ring_distance_offset", "damage_radius", "has_outer_ring", "aether_remnant_count", "artifice_duration_override_tooltip", "artifice_pct_effectiveness_tooltip", "artifice_extra_offset", "root_duration", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_resonant_pulse", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·共鸣脉冲", "name_en": "Resonant Pulse", "description_zh": "虚无之灵将自己包裹在保护性护盾之中，可以吸收物理伤害，并围绕自身发出一次伤害性脉冲。脉冲每击中一名敌方英雄，护盾的伤害吸收量都会提升。", "description_en": "Void Spirit wraps himself in a protective shield that absorbs physical damage and emits a single damaging pulse around him. The shield gains increased damage absorption for each enemy hero the pulse hits.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "共鸣脉冲可以沉默敌人，并获得%max_charges%点能量点数。", "en": "Causes Resonant Pulse to silence and gain %max_charges% charges."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "speed", "damage", "buff_duration", "base_absorb_amount", "absorb_per_hero_hit", "is_all_barrier", "return_projectile_speed", "max_charges", "charge_restore_time", "silence_duration_scepter", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "damage_block", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "silence", "condition": "scepter"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_intrinsic_edge", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·内在优势", "name_en": "Intrinsic Edge", "description_zh": "虚无之灵从每点属性获得的攻击力提升%damage_stat_bonus_pct%%%，并且从力量中获得的生命恢复、敏捷中获得的攻击速度和智力中获得的魔法恢复提升%secondary_stat_bonus_pct%%%。", "description_en": "Void Spirit gains %damage_stat_bonus_pct%%% more attack damage per point of each attribute, and %secondary_stat_bonus_pct%%% more HP regen from Strength, attack speed from Agility, and mana regen from Intelligence.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["secondary_stat_bonus_pct", "damage_stat_bonus_pct", "attack_damage", "hp_regen", "armor", "mp_regen", "magic_resist", "attackspeed"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "mana_gain", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_astral_step", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·太虚之径", "name_en": "Astral Step", "description_zh": "虚无之灵撕裂现实进入精神位面，再出现在目标地点，对沿途的所有敌人造成伤害。此次攻击将施加一个太虚印记，造成%pop_damage_delay%秒减速，然后引爆。", "description_en": "Void Spirit tears a rift through the astral plane to appear at the target location, attacking all enemies along the path. This attack inflicts a void mark that slows for %pop_damage_delay% seconds and then detonates.", "notes_zh": ["太虚之径的攻击不会分裂。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "min_travel_distance", "max_travel_distance", "pop_damage_delay", "pop_damage", "movement_slow_pct", "crit_damage", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "cleave", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "snapfire_scatterblast", "name_zh": "电炎绝手·电光石火", "name_en": "Scatterblast", "description_zh": "电炎绝手开枪产生大范围的爆炸，对锥形区域内的敌人造成伤害和减速。平射距离内的伤害提升%point_blank_dmg_bonus_pct%%%，移动速度减缓、攻击速度降低和减速持续时间额外提升%point_blank_debuff_duration_pct%%%。", "description_en": "Snapfire unloads with a wide blast that damages and slows enemies in a cone. Damage is increased by %point_blank_dmg_bonus_pct%%% and Movement Slow, Attack Slow and Slow Duration are increased by %point_blank_debuff_duration_pct%%% for enemies caught at point-blank range.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "blast_speed", "blast_width_initial", "blast_width_end", "debuff_duration", "movement_slow_pct", "attack_slow_pct", "point_blank_range", "point_blank_dmg_bonus_pct", "point_blank_debuff_duration_pct", "bonus_applies_at_long_range", "shard_knockback_distance", "shard_knockback_duration", "shard_stun_duration", "shard_bonus_point_blank_dmg_pct"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "snapfire_firesnap_cookie", "name_zh": "电炎绝手·龙炎饼干", "name_en": "Firesnap Cookie", "description_zh": "电炎绝手将一块烈性饼干喂给小莫迪或一名队友，使他们短距离跳跃。跳跃的单位将在落地时对敌人造成眩晕和伤害。", "description_en": "Snapfire feeds a potent cookie to Mortimer or an ally, causing them to hop a short distance. The hopping unit stuns and damages enemies in the landing zone.", "notes_zh": ["饼干的弹道速度为%projectile_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "龙炎饼干变得更具威力，治疗目标，并且朝着陆地点发射一个%shard_damage_multiplier_tooltip%%%冲击伤害的蜥蜴绝吻。", "en": "Firesnap cookies become even more potent, healing the target and launching a Mortimer Kiss that does %shard_damage_multiplier_tooltip%%% impact damage to the landing destination."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["projectile_speed", "jump_duration", "jump_height", "jump_horizontal_distance", "pre_land_anim_time", "landing_gesture_duration", "impact_radius", "impact_damage", "impact_stun_duration", "self_cast_delay", "target_heal", "shard_damage_multiplier_tooltip", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "snapfire_lil_shredder", "name_zh": "电炎绝手·霹雳铁手", "name_en": "Lil' Shredder", "description_zh": "电炎绝手开动蜥蜴坐骑上的加农炮，快速发动%buffed_attacks%次固定伤害加上自身攻击伤害一定百分比的攻击。每次攻击都将削弱敌人的护甲。在持续时间内提供攻击距离加成。", "description_en": "Snapfire heats up her mounted turret to rapidly fire %buffed_attacks% attacks dealing fixed damage plus a percentage of her attack damage. Each attack reduces the enemy's armor. Provides bonus attack range for the duration.", "notes_zh": ["持续时间内基础攻击间隔变为%base_attack_time%。", "霹雳铁手的攻击也有几率触发攻击特效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "buffed_attacks", "damage_pct", "attack_speed_bonus", "attack_range_bonus", "buff_duration_tooltip", "base_attack_time", "armor_reduction_per_attack", "armor_duration", "extra_targets", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "armor_reduction", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "snapfire_spit_creep", "name_zh": "电炎绝手·喷吐", "name_en": "Spit Out", "description_zh": "小莫迪吐出他肚子里的单位，对大片区域造成冲击伤害和眩晕。留下的火痰根据蜥蜴绝吻的当前等级还将持续造成减速和伤害。喷吐没有最小发射距离。", "description_en": "Mortimer spits out the unit that's in his mouth, causing impact damage and stun in a large area. The glob leaves a pool of firespit based on the current level of Mortimer Kisses, that slows and applies damage over time. Spit Out has a no minimum launch range.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["projectile_speed", "projectile_width", "impact_radius", "projectile_vision", "burn_interval", "burn_damage", "move_slow_pct", "burn_ground_duration", "min_lob_travel_time", "max_lob_travel_time", "burn_linger_duration", "stun_duration", "min_height_above_lowest", "min_height_above_highest", "min_acceleration"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "scepter"}]}, {"subject": "snapfire_mortimer_kisses", "name_zh": "电炎绝手·蜥蜴绝吻", "name_en": "Mortimer Kisses", "description_zh": "电炎绝手的伙伴在%duration_tooltip%秒内喷吐出密集的火团。火团造成冲击伤害，在地面上产生炽烈的炎洼，可以使敌人减速并造成持续伤害。电炎绝手在持续时间内转身速率降低，并且具有最小喷吐距离，为%min_range%。点击右键可以选择火团的目标区域。", "description_en": "Snapfire's friend launches a barrage of firespit globs over %duration_tooltip% seconds. Globs cause impact damage and create pools of firespit, which slow and apply damage over time. Snapfire has a reduced turn rate for the duration and a minimum launch range of %min_range%. Each glob can be targeted with a right click.", "notes_zh": ["可以通过停止、停在原位或使用其他技能来终止。", "最短飞行时间为%min_lob_travel_time%秒，最长飞行时间为%max_lob_travel_time%秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["projectile_count", "has_bonus_projectile", "projectile_speed", "projectile_width", "impact_radius", "damage_per_impact", "duration_tooltip", "projectile_vision", "turn_rate", "burn_interval", "burn_damage", "move_slow_pct", "burn_ground_duration", "dist_change_speed", "min_range"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_acorn_shot", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·爆栗出击", "name_en": "Acorn Shot", "description_zh": "森海飞霞向目标单位发射一颗橡栗，可以弹射至附近敌人，减缓他们的移动速度，并造成攻击伤害的一定百分比和额外伤害。\n可以对地面施放，在目标地点种出一棵树，而橡栗会弹射至附近目标。设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后会强制沿用该行为。", "description_en": "Fires Hoodwink's attack with an acorn at the target unit.  The acorn bounces to nearby targets, slowing them and dealing a percentage of Hoodwink's attack with bonus damage.\nIf point targeted, a tree is created at the target position and the acorn will bounce to nearby targets.  The ability may be placed on alt-cast to force this behavior.", "notes_zh": ["同一个目标可以被击中超过一次。", "弹射会搜寻525范围内战争迷雾中的单位，但无视隐身单位。", "种下的树持续20秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_range", "acorn_shot_damage", "base_damage_pct", "bounce_count", "bounce_range", "debuff_duration", "slow", "bounce_delay", "projectile_speed", "can_bounce_off_of_trees", "bounces_after_tree_bounce", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_bushwhack", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·野地奇袭", "name_en": "Bushwhack", "description_zh": "扔出一张网，对区域内靠近树木的敌人造成眩晕。敌人会持续受到伤害并被拖拽到目标区域内最近的树上，并且眩晕期间视野降低至0。", "description_en": "Tosses a net trap that stuns enemies if they are near a tree in the area.  Affected enemies take damage over time and are pulled towards the tree nearest to them within the target area, and have their vision reduced to 0 for the duration of the stun.", "notes_zh": ["若树木被摧毁，被影响的单位将解除眩晕。", "野地奇袭不会击中隐身单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["trap_radius", "debuff_duration", "projectile_speed", "total_damage", "animation_rate", "visual_height", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "tree_destroy", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_scurry", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·密林奔走", "name_en": "Scurry", "description_zh": "森海飞霞在短时间内获得移动速度加成，相位移动状态和穿行树木效果。开启时林渊旅人的转向几率为%evasion_multiplier%倍。", "description_en": "Hoodwink gains bonus movement speed, phased movement, and tree-walking for a brief time. While active, the redirect chance of Mistwoods Wayfarer is multiplied by %evasion_multiplier%.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movement_speed_pct", "duration", "radius", "evasion_multiplier", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "evasion", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "phased", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "tree_walk", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_decoy", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·诱敌奇术", "name_en": "Decoy", "description_zh": "森海飞霞变为隐身，提升移动速度，并且产生一个引诱敌人的幻象，幻象会瞄准最近的敌方英雄开始蓄力准备发射伤害较低的一箭穿心。如果幻象被攻击或被指向性技能击中，幻象将被摧毁并且攻击者将受到较弱的野地奇袭效果。", "description_en": "Hoodwink turns invisible, increasing her movement speed, and creates a decoy illusion that starts aiming a decreased damage Sharpshooter at the nearest enemy hero. If the illusion is attacked or hit by a targeted ability, it is destroyed and it throws a lesser bushwhack towards the enemy.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "decoy_detonate_radius", "decoy_stun_duration", "images_do_damage_percent", "images_take_damage_percent", "projectile_speed", "movement_speed", "sharpshooter_damage_pct", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "illusions", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "invisibility", "condition": "scepter"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_hunters_boomerang", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·猎手旋镖", "name_en": "Hunter's Boomerang", "description_zh": "掷出一把沿弧线飞行的回旋镖。击中后会飞回至森海飞霞。回旋镖对沿途击中的敌人都会造成伤害，并且施加一个负面效果，使受到作用的敌人被减速，承受的技能伤害增加。", "description_en": "Tosses a boomerang in an arc. Upon contact, it returns to Hoodwink.  The boomerang will deal damage as it passes through or hits enemies, and apply a debuff that causes affected enemies to be slowed and be more vulnerable to spell damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "radius", "damage", "mark_duration", "slow_pct", "spell_amp", "spread", "min_throw_duration", "max_throw_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_sharpshooter", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·一箭穿心", "name_en": "Sharpshooter", "description_zh": "森海飞霞装载她的弩机，射出致命的一箭，对一名敌方英雄造成高额伤害，并施加破坏和减速效果。伤害和负面状态持续时间随着装载时间增加，%max_charge_time%秒后达到最大效果，弩箭在%misfire_time%秒后自动发射。\n由于弩箭的威力，森海飞霞后退%recoil_distance%距离。弩箭穿过的非英雄单位会受到半额伤害。", "description_en": "Hoodwink charges up and fires a deadly bolt from her crossbow, dealing heavy damage, break and slow to an enemy Hero.  The damage and debuff duration scale up to max after %max_charge_time% seconds, and the bolt is fired automatically after %misfire_time% seconds.\nHoodwink is knocked backwards for a distance of %recoil_distance% from the force of the shot. Creeps hit by the bolt are damaged for half the values.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升箭矢速度和减速效果。", "en": "Increases arrow speed and movement speed slow."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["arrow_speed", "arrow_width", "arrow_range", "arrow_vision", "max_charge_time", "max_damage", "recoil_distance", "recoil_height", "recoil_duration", "max_slow_debuff_duration", "misfire_time", "slow_move_pct", "turn_rate", "turn_rate_tooltip", "vision_along_indicator"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "applies_break", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_fire_wreath", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·星破天惊", "name_en": "Starbreaker", "description_zh": "破晓辰星将她的战锤旋转3次，对敌人造成攻击伤害以及额外伤害。最后一次打击时，她将战锤击向地面，对她前方的敌人造成眩晕和伤害。", "description_en": "Dawnbreaker whirls her hammer around 3 times, damaging enemies with her attack plus bonus damage. On the final strike, she smashes her hammer down, stunning and damaging enemies in front of her.", "notes_zh": ["破晓辰星在技能持续时间内以%movement_speed%的移动速度行进，并且最后一击后需要%self_stun_duration%秒才能复原。", "连击期间无法施放上界重锤或天光现世。", "此技能不继承分裂效果。", "可以对自身施放来向前移动。", "前两次挥击会减少敌人%swipe_slow%%%移动速度，持续%sweep_stun_duration%秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "破晓辰星在星破天惊期间获得减益免疫，%immunity_resist%%%魔法抗性加成和自由移动状态。破晓辰星会被减速%shard_movement_penalty%%%，移速最低为%movement_speed%。", "en": "Dawnbreaker gains debuff immunity with %immunity_resist%%% magic resistance and free movement during Starbreaker. Dawnbreaker is slowed by %shard_movement_penalty%%% down to a minimum of %movement_speed%."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "swipe_radius", "swipe_damage", "smash_radius", "smash_damage", "movement_speed", "total_attacks", "smash_stun_duration", "sweep_stun_duration", "self_stun_duration", "swipe_slow", "smash_distance_from_hero", "turn_rate", "shard_cast_point", "shard_movement_penalty"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "cleave", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "debuff_immunity", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_celestial_hammer", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·上界重锤", "name_en": "Celestial Hammer", "description_zh": "破晓辰星向一个目标扔出她的武器，对沿途的敌人造成伤害。战锤会在目的地停留%pause_duration%秒，再飞回她的手中，期间留下一道炽烈之径，减缓敌人的移动速度。破晓辰星可以随时召回战锤，将自身朝战锤牵引，使二者在中点相遇。", "description_en": "Dawnbreaker hurls her weapon at a target, damaging enemies struck along the way. The hammer pauses for %pause_duration% seconds at the destination before flying back to her, leaving a trail of fire that slows enemies. Dawnbreaker can recall the hammer at any time, pulling her towards it so they meet in the middle.", "notes_zh": ["战锤在飞出和飞回时都会对敌人造成伤害。", "破晓辰星的会合移动距离不会超过技能的施法距离。", "星破天惊无法在战锤脱手时施放。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hammer_damage", "projectile_radius", "projectile_speed", "flare_debuff_duration", "flare_radius", "move_slow", "targets_allies", "burn_damage", "burn_interval", "pause_duration", "hammer_aoe_radius", "travel_speed_pct", "return_anim_distance_threshold", "range", "hammer_solar_guardian_radius"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}]}
